@.str.448 = private unnamed_addr constant [640 x i8] c"\0A\0A# Examples\0A\0A* Show what changed between each version of the NixOS system\0A  profile:\0A\0A  ```console\0A  # nix profile diff-closures --profile /nix/var/nix/profiles/system\0A  Version 13 -> 14:\0A    acpi-call: 2020-04-07-5.8.13 \E2\86\92 2020-04-07-5.8.14\0A    aws-sdk-cpp: -6723.1 KiB\0A    \E2\80\A6\0A\0A  Version 14 -> 15:\0A    acpi-call: 2020-04-07-5.8.14 \E2\86\92 2020-04-07-5.8.16\0A    attica: -996.2 KiB\0A    breeze-icons: -78713.5 KiB\0A    brotli: 1.0.7 \E2\86\92 1.0.9, +44.2 KiB\0A  ```\0A\0A# Description\0A\0AThis command shows the difference between the closures of subsequent\0Aversions of a profile. See [`nix store\0Adiff-closures`](nix3-store-diff-closures.md) for details.\0A\0A\00", align 1
