@.str.451 = private unnamed_addr constant [31 x i8] c"show all versions of a profile\00", align 1
@.str.452 = private unnamed_addr constant [724 x i8] c"\0A\0A# Examples\0A\0A* Show the changes between each version of your default profile:\0A\0A  ```console\0A  # nix profile history\0A  Version 508 (2020-04-10):\0A    flake:nixpkgs#legacyPackages.x86_64-linux.awscli: \E2\88\85 -> 1.17.13\0A\0A  Version 509 (2020-05-16) <- 508:\0A    flake:nixpkgs#legacyPackages.x86_64-linux.awscli: 1.17.13 -> 1.18.211\0A  ```\0A\0A# Description\0A\0AThis command shows what packages were added, removed or upgraded\0Abetween subsequent versions of a profile. It only shows top-level\0Apackages, not dependencies; for that, use [`nix profile\0Adiff-closures`](./nix3-profile-diff-closures.md).\0A\0AThe addition of a package to a profile is denoted by the string `\E2\88\85 ->`\0A*version*, whereas the removal is denoted by *version* `-> \E2\88\85`.\0A\0A\00", align 1
